---
description: Do not add comments unless the user asks for that comment.
alwaysApply: true
---

Do not add line comments, block comments, JSDoc, docstrings, banners, or commented-out code.

Write the behavior in names, types, and structure. Add a comment only when the user explicitly asks for one, and add only that comment.

An inline `-- reason` tool directive is allowed. A `SAFETY:` comment is allowed only on a cast whose invariant the type system cannot see.
